    "description": "Bunker: Zombie Survival Games or survival shelter games - post apocalyptic atmospheric stalker adventure 3D.\r\n\r\nYou are a geneticist who woke up in a forest house. Everyone you knew has turned into bloodthirsty zombies, the world is dying out due to secret experiment underground apocalypse lone survivor adventure. The only way to prevent disaster is to go to an underground laboratory to create a cure and save those who are still alive at hobo world the last shelter survival games.\r\n\r\nArm yourself to the teeth, because the most vicious monsters will stand in your way. Solve puzzles, look for items, manage resources, do everything possible to save the world from a terrible epidemic, because only you can do it at difficult, refuge biohazard last zombie survival games.\r\n\r\nAn exciting adventure, an interesting plot and dangerous traps await you in exile survival city dead by daylight in the zombie games. Are you ready to face your fears? Then nothing will stop you at survival simulator of postapocalyptic wasteland world 2033 years.\r\n\r\nIf you like state of survival and zombie shelter war 2 dayz mobile adventure survival pocket mobile game, then you will definitely like our game. Feel armageddon road to survival fort games.\r\n\r\nGame Features:\r\n- exciting story\r\n- extensive arsenal\r\n- story puzzles\r\n- terrible monsters\r\n- exciting adventure\r\nwe tried to bring the best to the game\r\n\r\nAtomic shelter turned in abandoned bunker, you need to survive stalker adventure and comprehend all the subtleties genre fallout games. If you play in metro 2033 offline it means you love post-apocalyptic world with challenging adventures, challenging monsters and dangerous situations, the postapocalypse world will give you what you desire. Simulator of  postapocalyptic survival world it is atmospheric stalker adventure looking for city last bunker. Postapocalyptic wasteland world without a single living being, inhabited by mutant plants, in the postapocalypse you have to solve problems to get to nuclear apocalypse shelter such rules in genre: build bunker games.\r\n\r\nIn this game, we have mixed the most beloved game genres: story adventure, action shooter and survival horror. This is a real gift to all gamers who really love video games abaut a sheltered city last bunker survival on infested territories.",
